OL,3,AI'm not tempted to call an early
OL,4,Aelection, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn early general election could give
OL,7,FBurnham a mandate of his own and free
OL,8,Fhim from commitments made in Labour's
OL,9,F2024 manifesto. The next general
OL,10,Felection must be held by August 2029.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
